Artwork bundled with Kintsugi OS.

The Kintsugi banner used by the boot splash and the About box lives at
data/kintsugiart/banner.svg (PNG rendered alongside it). It is © Kintsugi OS
Project, distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

The cursors/, fonts/, icons/, userguide/ and boot_splash/splash_icons* assets
are inherited from Haiku and released under the MIT license, except where
overridden by per-directory ReadMe files.

The single remaining Haiku-trademarked file in this directory,
"HAIKU logo - white on blue - big.png", is used by Tracker as the default
desktop background. The HAIKU logo is a registered trademark of Haiku, Inc.
(see http://www.haiku-inc.org/trademarks.html).
